    {
      "id": "t-implicit-object-transformed-75c2e6",
      "name": "TImplicitObjectTransformed",
      "category": "ImplicitObjectTransformed",
      "signature": "TImplicitObjectTransformed(Object Owner, Transformed)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Object Owner",
          "type": "TUniquePtr<Chaos::FImplicitObject>&&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Transformed",
          "type": "TRigidTransform<T,d>& InTransform ) : FImplicitObject ( EImplicitObject::HasBoundingBox,ImplicitObjectType::"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Transform the contained shape. If you pass a TUniquePtr to the constructor, ownership is transferred to the TransformedImplicit. If you pass a\nSerializablePtr, the lifetime of the object must be handled externally (do not delete it before deleting the TransformedImplicit).\n@template bSerializable Whether the shape can be serialized (usually true). Set to false for transient/stack-allocated objects."
    },
